<Controller Use="Target" Name="SoftwareStandardization" ProcessorType="1756-L83E" MajorRev="37" MinorRev="1" ProjectCreationDate="Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:28:35 GMT" LastModifiedDate="Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:28:35 GMT" SFCExecutionControl="CurrentActive" SFCRestartPosition="MostRecent" SFCLastScan="DontScan" ProjectSN="16#0000_0000" MatchProjectToController="false" CanUseRPIFromProducer="false" InhibitAutomaticFirmwareUpdate="0" PassThroughConfiguration="EnabledWithAppend" DownloadProjectDocumentationAndExtendedProperties="true" DownloadProjectCustomProperties="true" ReportMinorOverflow="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[JARVIS FIRST DRAFT - SDC machine-level (tier-3) programs for controls lead review. Generated Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:28:35 GMT.
EVIDENCE: Alarms / HMI / Production transcribed from X-drive exports; station contract, UDTs, AOI interfaces from V4.2 templates; TopAlarms / batch counter / Recipe / q_MachineStopReason from the Revision History.
INFERENCE: Supervisor internals, Tracking internals, Recipe program, LightStackControl AOI - every inferred rung carries a JARVIS INFERENCE comment.
Machine shape: INDEXING DIAL (matches S00 indexer templates). Linear / robot-cell differences noted in the MainTask description and rung comments.
NOT A DOWNLOADABLE PROJECT: AOI definitions marked STUB carry interfaces only - import the SDC standard AOIs over them; no Modules section; station programs are context references.]]>
</Description>
