<Program Use="Target" Name="Supervisor" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="R00_Main" Disabled="false" Class="Standard" UseAsFolder="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[JARVIS DRAFT - machine mode management, cycle start/stop latching, safety aggregation, fault reset distribution, light stack, machine cycle time. The Supervisor program was never exported by SDC; only its five-output station contract is evidenced. Everything else is marked JARVIS INFERENCE for the controls leads to confirm or correct.]]>
</Description>
