<Description>
<![CDATA[Why the cycle last stopped (added V4.1). JARVIS INFERENCE on code map: 0=Running/None 1=Operator 2=Manual Mode 3=Safety 4=Fault 5=Batch Complete]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
