</Tag>
<Tag Name="ShiftRuntime" TagType="Base" DataType="TIMER" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,1000,0]]]>
</Data>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="IdealCycleTime" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Constant="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Ideal machine cycle time in seconds (V4.1 constant) - *Set per machine]]>
</Description>
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[2.0]]>
</Data>
</Tag>
</Tags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="R00_Main" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Subroutine Calls]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(R01_ProductionData,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(R02_ShiftData,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R01_ProductionData" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Production Data

Evidence: transcribed from X:\...\Programs\Production Data\Production.L5X (V2.2-era export) with the ten V4.1 revision-history changes applied. V4.1 rungs are marked JARVIS INFERENCE where the revision history names the change but not the logic.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Good Parts

Evidence rung used g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff with ***NOTE - Replace MachineBasic.AlwaysOff With Good Part Trigger***. JARVIS wires it to the Tracking good-part pulse.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Tracking.q_GoodPartPulse)ONS(ONS.0)ADD(ProductionData.Good,1,ProductionData.Good);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reject Parts]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Tracking.q_RejectPartPulse)ONS(ONS.1)ADD(ProductionData.Reject,1,ProductionData.Reject);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Total Parts]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[ADD(ProductionData.Good,ProductionData.Reject,ProductionData.Total);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Good Part Efficiency]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ProductionData.GoodPercent,(ProductionData.Good/ProductionData.Total)*100);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reject Part Efficiency]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ProductionData.RejectPercent,(ProductionData.Reject/ProductionData.Total)*100);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Runtime (min)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineRunning)[RTO(CycleRuntime,?,?) ,XIC(CycleRuntime.DN) ADD(ProductionData.RuntimeSec,1,ProductionData.RuntimeSec) DIV(ProductionData.RuntimeSec,60,ProductionData.RuntimeMin) RES(CycleRuntime) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Downtime (min)

V4.1: downtime only accumulates on FAULT stop, not cycle stop. JARVIS INFERENCE on the exact condition: not running AND the last stop was a fault (q_MachineFaultActive OR stop reason 4).]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Supervisor.q_MachineRunning)[XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineFaultActive) ,EQ(\Supervisor.q_MachineStopReason,4) ][RTO(CycleDowntime,?,?) ,XIC(CycleDowntime.DN) ADD(ProductionData.DowntimeSec,1,ProductionData.DowntimeSec) DIV(ProductionData.DowntimeSec,60,ProductionData.DowntimeMin) RES(CycleDowntime) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Elapsed Time (sec / min) - V4.1 members. JARVIS INFERENCE on formulas.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[ADD(ProductionData.RuntimeSec,ProductionData.DowntimeSec,ProductionData.ElapsedSec) ,DIV(ProductionData.ElapsedSec,60,ProductionData.ElapsedMin) ,MOVE(ProductionData.ElapsedMin,ProductionData.ElapsedTime) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Good Rate Per Min (V4.1: REAL)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ProductionData.GoodRate,(ProductionData.Good/ProductionData.RuntimeMin));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Parts Per Minute - V4.1 member. JARVIS INFERENCE: total parts over elapsed minutes.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GT(ProductionData.ElapsedMin,0)CPT(ProductionData.PPM,(ProductionData.Total/ProductionData.ElapsedMin));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Perfect Run Total - V4.1 member. JARVIS INFERENCE: parts a zero-loss run would have produced in the elapsed time.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ProductionData.PerfectRunTotal,(ProductionData.ElapsedSec/IdealCycleTime));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[OEE

***NOTE - PlannedProductionTime Input Must Equal Total Shift Time (480 Minutes) - Planned Downtime (Breaks, Lunches, ect.) In Minutes***
***NOTE - IdealCycleTime Input Must Equal Cycle Time Of Machine In Seconds***]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OEE(ProductionDataOEE,480,ProductionData.RuntimeSec,ProductionData.DowntimeSec,IdealCycleTime,ProductionData.Total,ProductionData.Good,ProductionData.Availability,ProductionData.Performance,ProductionData.Quality,ProductionData.OEE);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Total Faults]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineRunning)XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineFaultActive)ONS(ONS.2)ADD(ProductionData.TotalFaults,1,ProductionData.TotalFaults);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset Total Counts]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(HMI_ResetPartCounts) ,XIC(HMI_ResetAllCounts) ]TON(HoldTimerA,?,?)XIC(HoldTimerA.DN)COP(EmptyData,ProductionData,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R02_ShiftData" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Shift Data - Uses Array Indexes 1,2,3

Calculate Shift Number

Evidence: shift 1 = 07:00, shift 2 = 15:00, shift 3 = 23:00.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[EQ(g_CPUDateTime.Hour,7) EQ(g_CPUDateTime.Minutes,0) ONS(ONS.3) MOVE(1,p_CurrentShift) MOVE(3,PreviousShift) ,EQ(g_CPUDateTime.Hour,15) EQ(g_CPUDateTime.Minutes,0) ONS(ONS.4) MOVE(2,p_CurrentShift) MOVE(1,PreviousShift) ,EQ(g_CPUDateTime.Hour,23) EQ(g_CPUDateTime.Minutes,0) ONS(ONS.5) MOVE(3,p_CurrentShift) MOVE(2,PreviousShift) ]OTE(ShiftChangedPulse);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Power-up shift recovery]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQ(p_CurrentShift,0)[LIMIT(7,g_CPUDateTime.Hour,14) MOVE(1,p_CurrentShift) ,LIMIT(15,g_CPUDateTime.Hour,22) MOVE(2,p_CurrentShift) ,LIMIT(23,g_CPUDateTime.Hour,6) MOVE(3,p_CurrentShift) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear the new shift bucket at shift change]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ShiftChangedPulse)COP(EmptyData,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift],1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Good Parts

Evidence rung used g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff with ***NOTE - Replace MachineBasic.AlwaysOff With Good Part Trigger***. JARVIS wires it to the Tracking good-part pulse.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Tracking.q_GoodPartPulse)ONS(ONS.6)ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Good,1,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Good);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reject Parts]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Tracking.q_RejectPartPulse)ONS(ONS.7)ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Reject,1,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Reject);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Total Parts]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Good,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Reject,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Total);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Good Part Efficiency]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].GoodPercent,(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Good/ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Total)*100);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reject Part Efficiency]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RejectPercent,(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Reject/ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Total)*100);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Runtime (min)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineRunning)[RTO(ShiftRuntime,?,?) ,XIC(ShiftRuntime.DN) ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeSec,1,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeSec) DIV(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeSec,60,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeMin) RES(ShiftRuntime) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Downtime (min)

V4.1: downtime only accumulates on FAULT stop, not cycle stop. JARVIS INFERENCE on the exact condition: not running AND the last stop was a fault (q_MachineFaultActive OR stop reason 4).]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Supervisor.q_MachineRunning)[XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineFaultActive) ,EQ(\Supervisor.q_MachineStopReason,4) ][RTO(ShiftDowntime,?,?) ,XIC(ShiftDowntime.DN) ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].DowntimeSec,1,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].DowntimeSec) DIV(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].DowntimeSec,60,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].DowntimeMin) RES(ShiftDowntime) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Elapsed Time (sec / min) - V4.1 members. JARVIS INFERENCE on formulas.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeSec,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].DowntimeSec,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedSec) ,DIV(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedSec,60,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedMin) ,MOVE(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedMin,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedTime) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Good Rate Per Min (V4.1: REAL)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].GoodRate,(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Good/ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeMin));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Parts Per Minute - V4.1 member. JARVIS INFERENCE: total parts over elapsed minutes.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GT(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedMin,0)CPT(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].PPM,(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Total/ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedMin));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Perfect Run Total - V4.1 member. JARVIS INFERENCE: parts a zero-loss run would have produced in the elapsed time.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].PerfectRunTotal,(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].ElapsedSec/IdealCycleTime));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[OEE

***NOTE - PlannedProductionTime Input Must Equal Total Shift Time (480 Minutes) - Planned Downtime (Breaks, Lunches, ect.) In Minutes***
***NOTE - IdealCycleTime Input Must Equal Cycle Time Of Machine In Seconds***]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OEE(ShiftDataOEE,480,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].RuntimeSec,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].DowntimeSec,IdealCycleTime,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Total,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Good,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Availability,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Performance,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].Quality,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].OEE);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Total Faults]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineRunning)XIC(\Supervisor.q_MachineFaultActive)ONS(ONS.8)ADD(ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].TotalFaults,1,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift].TotalFaults);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset Current Shift Count]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_ResetCurrentShift)TON(HoldTimerB,?,?)XIC(HoldTimerB.DN)COP(EmptyData,ShiftData[p_CurrentShift],1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset All Shift Count]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(HMI_ResetAllShift) ,XIC(HMI_ResetAllCounts) ]TON(HoldTimerC,?,?)XIC(HoldTimerC.DN)COP(EmptyData,ShiftData[1],1)COP(EmptyData,ShiftData[2],1)COP(EmptyData,ShiftData[3],1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
<Program Use="Target" Name="Recipe" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="R00_Main" Disabled="false" Class="Standard" UseAsFolder="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[PURE JARVIS INFERENCE - Recipe program added V4.2 with PanelView 5310 example HMI; no export exists and no station consumes \Recipe tags. Proposal for review.]]>
</Description>
<Tags>
<Tag Name="p_CurrentRecipeNum" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Usage="Public" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Recipe currently loaded into the machine]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="p_RecipeLoaded" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Usage="Public" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[A recipe is loaded and matches the selection]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="HMI_RecipeSelect" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[HMI - recipe number selected on the PanelView 5310 recipe screen]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="HMI_LoadRecipe" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[HMI momentary - load the selected recipe]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="HMI_SaveRecipe" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[HMI momentary - save active parameters into the selected recipe slot]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="RecipeStore" TagType="Base" DataType="RecipeData" Dimensions="8" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Recipe storage - *size per machine]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="ActiveRecipe" TagType="Base" DataType="RecipeData" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Parameters the machine is currently running]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="ONS" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[One shot storage bits]]>
</Description>
</Tag>
</Tags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="R00_Main" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Subroutine Calls]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(R01_Recipe,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R01_Recipe" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Recipe Management

PURE JARVIS INFERENCE: V4.2 added a Recipe program and a PanelView 5310 example HMI, but nothing was exported and no station references \Recipe tags. This is JARVIS's proposal of the minimum viable SDC-style recipe program for the leads to correct: numbered recipe slots, HMI load/save handshake, load blocked while the cycle is running.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Load Selected Recipe - only while the machine cycle is stopped]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_LoadRecipe)XIC(\Supervisor.q_CycleStopped)ONS(ONS.0)LIMIT(0,HMI_RecipeSelect,7)[COP(RecipeStore[HMI_RecipeSelect],ActiveRecipe,1) ,MOVE(HMI_RecipeSelect,p_CurrentRecipeNum) ,OTL(p_RecipeLoaded) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Save Active Parameters Into Selected Slot]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_SaveRecipe)ONS(ONS.1)LIMIT(0,HMI_RecipeSelect,7)COP(ActiveRecipe,RecipeStore[HMI_RecipeSelect],1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Recipe Loaded Flag Drops When Selection Changes]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NE(HMI_RecipeSelect,p_CurrentRecipeNum)OTU(p_RecipeLoaded);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Distribute Recipe Parameters

*Replace always off with real distribution - copy ActiveRecipe.Parameter[n] into the consuming tags (HMI_XAxis.Parameters.Positions[n], batch targets, vision job numbers, etc.) per machine.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
