<Tasks>
<Task Name="MainTask" Type="CONTINUOUS" Priority="10" Watchdog="500" DisableUpdateOutputs="false" InhibitTask="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[JARVIS INFERENCE - scheduled program order for an indexing dial machine:
1. Supervisor - mode, safety, and cycle decisions land before any station acts on them this scan
2. S00_IndexerSP - the indexer moves the dial and recomputes every station's NestNum (R10) before stations consume it
3. S01_PartLoad, then S05_ServoPNP - process stations in dial order
4. Tracking - sees this scan's Attempt/Success latches; owns nest lifecycle and batch counting
5. Alarms - aggregates every program's q_AlarmActive/q_WarningActive after they have all executed
6. Production, HMI, Recipe - reporting and operator interface last
LINEAR MACHINE NOTE: swap S00_IndexerSP for S00_IndexerNoSP (per revision history the NoSP variant doubles as the linear indexer); station order follows part flow.
ROBOT CELL NOTE: no S00 program - the robot program(s) take its slot and the handshake becomes robot interface signals instead of q_WaitStationsComplete.]]>
</Description>
<ScheduledPrograms>
<ScheduledProgram Name="Supervisor"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="S00_IndexerSP"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="S01_PartLoad"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="S05_ServoPNP"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="Tracking"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="Alarms"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="Production"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="HMI"/>
<ScheduledProgram Name="Recipe"/>
</ScheduledPrograms>
</Task>
</Tasks>
</Controller>
